  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_header.gif\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">⚠️&nbsp;</span></strong>需要支援<strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"> CurseForge </span></strong>模組包的啟動器<strong><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">&nbsp;</span>&raquo;<span style=\"color:#843fa1\">&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#843fa1\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/download/app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下載 CurseForge App</a></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Light Craft</span> </strong>|<strong> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">最佳 FPS 提升模組包</span></span> </strong>by<strong> <span style=\"color:#3598db\">MoonPlay Team&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">提升遊戲內的 FPS（比<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">OptiFine<span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span></span>&amp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">其他模組包</span>還要高！並新增實用額外功能！&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">最新版本 &raquo; <strong>26.1.2 -<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\"> <span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">7.2.6&nbsp;</span></span></strong>(<strong><span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">推薦版本</span></strong>)<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">&nbsp;</span><strong>/ 26.2&nbsp;</strong>-&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">8.1.1</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">我們正在致力於打造基於<span style=\"color:#fff\">Light Craft</span>、擁有各種附加元件的最優化客戶端。</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">不需要為<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">LightCraft</span>搭配<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">OptiFine</span>附加元件？</span>您只關心基本的<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">FPS 提升</span>嗎？您可以下載&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lightcraftprojectlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Light Craft&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4;text-decoration:underline\">Lite</span></span></strong></span></a>！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">想要架設自己的<span style=\"color:#c2e0f4\">伺服器</span>嗎？試試我們的<span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>伺服器模組包</strong></span>！<span style=\"color:#34495e\">Fabric 伺服器</span>已盡可能最佳化。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/2gQGYw3qfF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"105\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoonplay-team.gitbook.io%252flight-craft%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&logo=bookstack&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"78\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/lightcraftprojectlite\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Lite version-2C2F33?style=for-the-badge&logo=quora&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"139\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_installation.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XP0u6PytMrk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/How_to_Install-Watch_on_YouTube-red?style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube\" alt=\"Generated button\" width=\"310\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252flightcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth Download-CLICK-green?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"\" width=\"247\" height=\"28\"></strong></span></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_description.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>為什麼您應該選擇&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#ecf0f1\">Light Craft</span>，而不是<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">OptiFine</span>和<span style=\"color:#e67e23\">其他模組包</span>？</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 該模組包比 OptiFine <span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">快上許多</span></span></span> 📈</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 支援披風（包含 OptiFine 披風），您還可以<strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmoonplay-team.gitbook.io%252flight-craft%252ffree-cape\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費</a></span></strong>取得！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 此模組包已包含 OptiFine 的所有主要功能，例如<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#bfedd2\"><strong>光影</strong>、<strong>縮放</strong>、<strong>動態光源，</strong></span><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#bfedd2\">資源包</span>等。</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 錯誤修復 🐞</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 每週<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">更新</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 您可以使用<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#236fa1\">手把</span>遊玩 🎮</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 您可以自行新增模組（例如<span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-voice-chat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遊戲內語音聊天</a>、<a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-world-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地圖</a>、<a style=\"color:#bfedd2\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/essential-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">基礎功能</a></span>等）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; 乾淨的介面</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>大幅提升 FPS ！</strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#ecf0f1\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Light_Craft_new/BH_Light_Craft_screenshots.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>NVIDIA RTX 2060 - Intel Core I5 10400F - SEED: \"test\" - 2 chunks - (測試日期：13.05.2025)</p>\n<p><strong>⚠️</strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">請記住，結果會因個人而異，取決於驅動程式版本、顯示卡品牌與版本、作業系統、處理器等。</span><strong>⚠️</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><a style=\"color:#e03e2d\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">原版</a> </span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo;&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">984 FPS</span></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiB4FMjWS6Vm8inn9r8oSeglW3sGKFiyhvWyfiAZ03Yl1MazWJaLY6_6MMu2kpWngbFA55watIBOcQ5S1qy_X-6o_9jMq256KcZP9c9cdle8gZ3hXy54QOmQbGOaUWmcIgovdTkb3hCVvkHx_Tm_44ZrbE1B9ZSq3sG4H-plXaCRAChBz2xSgQrLdKz1uSv\" width=\"806\" height=\"453\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><a style=\"color:#ba372a\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OptiFine (HD_U_J3)</a> </span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; </span></strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">1008 FPS</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblogger.googleusercontent.com%252fimg%252fa%252fAVvXsEgmtdEO_nKU-AijkaoA_3ItKROAETnqxEshgz8Ica8Ud875g3AFu2OHPMCKA0OOGDMg-UUA47GzpOaMHxJgHhl461lP0Io_MzpGwHFigzAUAFpv2R5S3e6PeABhhXJeMGvpl1lfO8HJgM_41T2qFnohfS1oHhRXacUjYxLTSWzCCzPKnfzoIG9_D4dodX-E\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/537750/description_8ff9ef86-e49a-431e-b75b-fbaabd032fd3.webp\"></strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/fabulously-optimized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabulously Optimized (9.0.0-beta.1)</a> </span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&raquo; </span></strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">69